VRML97 parser
-------------

This directory contains a fully re-entrant VRML97 parser library
written by Lee Iverson at SRI International. VRML97 (Virtual Reality
Modeling Language) is an ISO standard for representing 3-D graphics
that may be distributed over the Web. For further details on VRML,
please refer to the Web3D Consortium home page at:

   http://www.web3d.org/

This library is included as part of the Open Source tsmApi library,
released by SRI International and available from:

   http://www.tsmApi.com/


